OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain and thunderstorms
OL,6,Fwill continue moving north through the
OL,7,Fday, with a risk of localised
OL,8,Fflooding. Intense downpours likely
OL,9,Fwith the risk of hail. Some drier,
OL,10,Fbrighter conditions will spread into
OL,11,Fthe south later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening with the
OL,14,Fodd shower that will ease overnight.
OL,15,FShowers return during the early hours,
OL,16,Fmainly in the south. Staying mild for
OL,17,Fall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
