OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FShowers continue in the south
OL,6,Fthrough the morning with more
OL,7,Fdeveloping later elsewhere into the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Showers move eastwards
OL,9,Fleaving some sunny spells. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAn
OL,13,Funsettled bank holiday weekend with
OL,14,Fshowers and possibly more thunder on
OL,15,Fthe way. Staying warm to start with
OL,16,Fbut turning fresher as winds shift to
OL,17,Fa westerly by Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
